The '''Sinta Glacier Colony''' was a settlement located on the [[Sinta Glacier]], a massive chunk of [[Water|ice]] orbiting the [[star]] [[Sinta]]. The [[Resistance]] operatives [[Finn]] and [[Poe Dameron]] underwent a [[Mission to Sinta Glacier Colony|mission]] to meet [[Boolio]] at the colony.<ref name="TROS VD" />

